  "releaseNotes": "[Fix] generate derived composite properties as List instead of IContainerList; fixes #286\n            [Fix] implement Element.OwnedElement derived property; fixes #288\n            [Improvement] return IReadOnlyList for derived/read-only collection properties; fixes #291\n            [Fix] Property::isComposite is aggregation = composite only; fixes #345\n            [Fix] set the owner end of a composite association on containment, and do not write it; fixes #432\n            [Breaking] optional [0..1] Boolean, Integer, Real and Enumeration properties are nullable; fixes #357, fixes #347\n            [Breaking] derived composite properties are exposed as IReadOnlyList; fixes #358\n            [Fix] QueryHasDefaultValue is true only when the property has a default value; fixes #389\n            [Fix] QueryRootPackage walks the whole owner chain to the outermost Package; fixes #388\n            [Fix] default values and upper bounds of any ValueSpecification no longer throw; fixes #390, fixes #391\n            [Fix] QueryIsTypeAbstract returns isAbstract of any Classifier; fixes #392\n            [Fix] untyped elements produce valid C# type names; fixes #395\n            [Fix] QueryAllSpecializations and QueryContainers find classifiers that are not packaged elements; fixes #393\n            [Fix] QueryAllOperations includes the realized interfaces like QueryAllProperties; fixes #394\n            [Fix] type classification helpers require a PrimitiveType and an exact name; fixes #387\n            [Fix] documentation uses every owned comment and keeps the words of adjacent lines apart; fixes #396\n            [Fix] QueryStructuralFeatureNameEqualsEnclosingType compares names independently of the culture; fixes #452\n            [Fix] QueryAllConstraints includes the preconditions and postconditions of a Behavior; fixes #453",
